  "reason": "The member's coverage became effective 2026-07-15, and the plan imposes a 90-day waiting period before benefits are payable. The requested date of service, 2026-08-14, falls only 30 days into the coverage period, well before the waiting period ends on approximately 2026-10-13. Because the waiting period had not elapsed on the date of service, the requested total knee arthroplasty (CPT 27447) cannot be authorized, regardless of the clinical documentation supporting medical necessity.",
